--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1 +1,17 @@
+# RIDES-SERVICE
 
+Fastify API starter for the rides service. Use Node.js 24.
+
+```sh
+npm ci
+npm run dev
+```
+
+The server defaults to `127.0.0.1:3000`. Set `HOST` and `PORT` to override the defaults. Use `npm start` to run without file watching.
+
+`GET /health` returns HTTP 200 with `{"status":"ok"}`. Invalid requests and unknown routes return HTTP 400 and 404 respectively, with an `error` object containing a `code` and `message`.
+
+```sh
+npm run typecheck
+npm test
+```
